WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:11.745
My name is Jocelyn.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:15.782
I am a member of the Voorhees
Toastmaster Club, District 38,

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:21.154
and I am the World
Champion of Public Speaking for 2023.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:25.992
Can you tell me every emotion
that is going through your body right now?

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:27.761
It's just surreal.

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:30.797
You ever have a wave of just,
"I can't believe this is happening?"

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:35.135
It's almost an out of body kind of vibe,
but it's just... I'm excited,

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:38.405
I'm ecstatic, I am speechless.

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:41.508
And it's just—

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.809
amazing.

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:45.478
What went through your mind when you heard

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:48.481
your name called as World Champion?

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:49.983
First thing: What?

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.317
What? Wait... what? Me?

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:55.755
Wait, me, me, just. Me?

00:00:55.822 --> 00:01:00.360
I think that was the first thing and
still feel like it's going on right now.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.095
Can this be me?

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:06.699
But I worked hard
and it was a labor of love.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.969
So I'm just grateful. Just grateful.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.073
Who helped get you to where you were?

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.140
It was definitely

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:18.144
family, friends, fellow Toastmasters,
non-Toastmasters,

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:20.980
and just different audiences
that I was bringing the speech to.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:24.084
I just wanted to be relatable to them

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:27.487
and everyone when I was giving that speech
because I practiced with them,

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:31.624
I spent time with them
and just pooled and cultivated this thing.

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:33.226
And that's who I thought of.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:36.229
And just also having fun
and remembering that day

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.964
and remembering what brought me there,

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:39.966
and that that speech was my story.

